## Context

The 0204 charter raid (tickets 0205-0214 + chore 0215) shipped: split
init/install, erg spec / erg integration print-on-demand, init dry-run/force +
exit-code table, install --hooks/--push-hook/--inject-agents, erg-github
forge layer, the .erg-assets provenance manifest, the dpkg 3-state asset
compare, the drift warning + post-update hint, the CI self-coherence guard,
and the erg version role field. The author asked for the real-world dogfood:
migrate this machine's erg stores to those capabilities -- "the real test of
the migrate script."

This ticket is the runbook. The READ-ONLY validation has been done (see
findings below). The actual mutating writes are DEFERRED to a supervised run:
the author was asleep, 8 of the 9 stores are repos git-erg does not own, and
3 are deliberate text-only adopters where vendoring a binary is the owner's
call -- not a 3am mechanical sweep. "Safely migrate" governs.

